      Wired to Shopify's Customer Privacy API so analytics/marketing consent
      flows through the native Shopify mechanism.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="dl-consent" id="dlConsent" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-label="Cookie preferences">
      <div class="dl-consent__inner">
        <div class="dl-consent__copy">
          <p class="dl-consent__title">We use cookies.</p>
